  1. Effects of an Aqueous Extract of  Withania somnifera  on Strength Training Adaptations and Recovery: The STAR Trial
     Tim N. Ziegenfuss, Anurag W. Kedia, Jennifer E. Sandrock, Betsy J. Raub, Chad M. Kerksick, Hector L....
     PMC6266766 · Nutrients · 2018-11-20
     https://doi.org/10.3390/nu10111807
     "This study investigated the effects of an aqueous *Withania somnifera* extract on strength training. The extract significantly improved strength gains, body composition, and recovery compared to placebo."

